        <p><strong>&#128176; Cost:</strong> Free. Registered with Banco de Portugal.</p>
      </div>

      <p>Financial Options also publishes an extensive library of practical guides that are genuinely worth reading before you start. Here are the ones most relevant to buying a holiday home:</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
